TEXT -1016 -168 Left 4 ;Formulas: for voltage drop along the two lines:\ndV1 = R1*i1  + Rm*i2 + Rm*i3 + L1*di1/dt  + Lm12*di2/dt + Lm13*di3/dt\ndV2 = Rm*i1 +  R2*i2 + Rm*i3 + Lm12*di1/dt + L2*di2/dt  + Lm23*di3/dt\ndV3=  Rm*i1 + Rm*i2 + R3*i3  + Lm13*di1/dt + Lm23*di2/dt +  L3*di3/dt\n \n \nsee also voltage path (only over resistances)\ndVr1 = Rm*(i1+i2+i3) + (R-Rm)*i1 = R *i1 + Rm*i2 + Rm*i3\ndVr2 = Rm*(i1+i2+i3) + (R-Rm)*i2 = Rm*i1 + R*i2  + Rm*i3\ndVr3 = Rm*(i1+i2+i3) + (R-Rm)*i3 = Rm*i1 + Rm*i2 + R*i3\n \nCompare with the formulas above
